EnergyCommunity.core.mcpServer

Scope & Responsibilities:
- Exposes Model Context Protocol (MCP) server endpoints and tool definitions for AI agent interaction.
- Provides standard tool capabilities: reading system state, inspecting forecasts, and proposing resource allocation schedules.
- Hosts the scheduled agentic workflow that evaluates system forecasts and formulates optimization recommendations.

Component Boundaries & Visibility:
- VISIBILITY: PROTOCOL BOUNDARY.
- Boundary Rule: Queries system state via service interfaces/events and submits suggested action plans for user/administrator approval.
- Agent reasoning, LLM orchestration, and MCP protocol transport mechanics remain internal to this component.
